      "file": "examples/apps/crosscut/src/main/java/net/terminalvalue/crosscut/ratelimit/TokenBucket.java",
      "startLine": 18,
      "code": "\n    /**\n     * The time up to which refills have been credited after the refill: {@code lastNanos} advanced by the whole\n     * periods that earned a token. The part of a period that has not earned one yet is left after it, so that a\n     * bucket polled more often than it refills still refills.\n     */\n    public static long lastAfter(long tokens, long lastNanos, long nowNanos, long periodNanos, long capacity) {\n        long periods = (nowNanos - lastNanos) / periodNanos;\n        return lastNanos + periods * periodNanos;\n    }\n}\n"
